1. productRepo.save(abcModel)
    Spring Data JPA ka save() method call hota hai.

2. Repository Proxy
    Spring Data JPA ka runtime-generated proxy method ko handle karta hai.

3. EntityManager
    Entity ki state check karke persist() ya merge() use karta hai.

4. Hibernate
    Entity ko manage karta hai aur required database operation prepare karta hai.

5. Persistence Context
    Entity ko track karta hai. Changes ko dirty checking se detect kar sakta hai.

6. Flush → JDBC
    Required SQL, jaise INSERT ya UPDATE, database ko bheja jaata hai.

7. Database
    SQL execute hota hai; transaction commit hone par changes commit hote hain.